1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,693
The AI only suggests scores.

2
00:00:02,693 --> 00:00:11,234
It reads the company's public site, finds competitors and analyses the market, and every claim must cite a fetched source, or it is dropped.

3
00:00:11,234 --> 00:00:17,263
A fixed, public formula then turns seven weighted dimensions into a grade and a valuation range.

4
00:00:17,263 --> 00:00:22,146
For Airwallex, it found eight real competitors, and graded it C.

